    "title": "Mirror - Makeup and Shaving",
    "description": "Don't want to carry around a Mirror just to check your appearance or put in contact lenses? Everything else is on your phone/tablet, so why shouldn't your Mirror be too? With over a million of downloads, Mirror app is the best of your choices. We are sure this free app will be the last Mirror app you try!\r\n\r\nThe Best Mirror app for your makeup and shaving with lights and so much more useful stuffs.\r\nIt's free app. Just enjoy.\r\n\r\n<b>Why is this mobile mirror app better than using your phone/tablet camera?</b>\r\n\u2713 Simpler to use than your phone/tablet's camera\r\n\u2713 One-touch lighting control\r\n\u2713 Work perfect even in darkness\r\n\u2713 On-screen zoom function\r\n\u2713 Custom color for icons which you like\r\n\u2713 <b>Many awesome mirror frames</b>\r\n\u2713 Image freezing so there is no more need to open your gallery after every photo\r\n\u2713 No hassle sharing photos or selfies through social media or email\r\n\u2713 3D photo to look around and behind you - we are testing on this function\r\n\r\nWhether it\u2019s makeup app or taking the best picture for the perfect Instagram selfie photo, we\u2019ve got you covered. Never carry around a compact mirror again!\r\n\r\nVanity mirror is no more needed with this makeup mirror with lights, light up makeup mirror magnifying mirror and makeup vanity with LED lights, enjoy your daily beauty routine with this light up mirror beauty makeup.\r\n\r\nThis can be a Makeup mirror, a Compact mirror, a Vanity Mirror, a Pocket mirror, a Shaving mirror, a Mobile mirror, a Smart mirror, a Simple mirror, a Mini mirror, a Hand mirror, a Free mirror, a Supper mirror.\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s a makeup mirror app taking the best picture for the perfect selfie photo.\r\nFinally you have found it! The most simple and functional mirror with light!\r\n\r\nMirror app is available in English, Fran\u00e7ais, Deutsch, \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4, \u65e5\u672c\u4eba, \u0440\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439, Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t, \u0639\u0631\u0628\u0649, \u4e2d\u56fd\u4eba, Italiano, Dansk, Nederlands, Magyar, Portuguesa, Espa\u00f1ola, Svenska, \u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22, \u0e9e\u0eb2\u0eaa\u0eb2\u0ea5\u0eb2\u0ea7, Melayu, Norsk, bahasa Indonesia, \u00cdslensku, Suomalainen\r\n\r\nThank you very much for using Mirror app !!! \ud83c\udf37\ud83c\udf37\ud83c\udf37\ud83c\udf37\r\n-------------------------------\r\n\r\nPlease send us your suggestions and feedback via the app, as we are always looking to add new features!\r\n\r\n===================\r\nTry to be The Best team\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/MirrorAppForMakeupAndShaving",
